s01Subject.body:
Stress Index is a software service provided by {company} (the "Provider") and made up of:

• the Stress Index mobile app, with which the professional or their client records heart rate variability (HRV) measurements with a compatible chest strap;
• the stressindex.io website and its reserved area ("Professional Area"), where the professional reviews measurements, trends over time, reports and the tools of the active modules;
• related services (email notifications, PDF reports, exports).

The service is intended for wellness and sports professionals (physiotherapists, osteopaths, trainers, coaches) who use it as part of their professional activity. It is not intended for consumers.

These Terms govern access to and use of the service. By creating an account or using the service you confirm that you have read and accepted them, together with the Privacy Notice and the Cookie Policy.

s04Obligations.body:
You agree to:

• use the service in compliance with the law, these Terms and the rules of your profession;
• obtain from their clients consent to the processing of data concerning health, using the form provided in the app, as required by the Data Processing Agreement (the professional is the data controller for their clients' data);
• not upload content that is unlawful, offensive or infringes third-party rights;
• not attempt to circumvent security measures, access other people's accounts or data, decompile or copy the software, or use the service to build a competing product;
• not use automated systems (scraping, bots) to extract data from the website or the app, other than the export functions provided;
• not resell or sublicense the service.

You are responsible for the content you enter (notes, client data, settings) and for the use you make of the information provided by the service.

